cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "Graph neural network prediction and explanation for acetylcholinesterase inhibitors"
abstract: >-
  Code, data splits, trained checkpoints, per-molecule predictions, metrics, and
  figures for a reproducible evaluation of a graph convolutional classifier for
  acetylcholinesterase inhibitors, reporting random-split and scaffold-disjoint
  performance separately, a paired comparison against an ECFP4 support vector
  classifier on identical folds, and a quantitative assessment of GNNExplainer
  attribution fidelity, stability, and sparsity.
type: software
authors:
